  "title": "Moroccan Carrot Salad",
  "description": "Just-tender carrots dressed warm in cumin, paprika, cinnamon, lemon, and a little honey, then left to soak it up. Part of any Moroccan spread of salads.",
  "cuisine": "Moroccan",
